     1|/**
     2| * InvestmentCard — the ONE canonical compact investment card for IVX.
     3| *
     4| * Used by:
     5| *   • Main/Home feed (InvestorFirstFeed) for deal blocks
     6| *   • Search results
     7| *   • Saved deals
     8| *   • Portfolio deal previews
     9| *
    10| * Visual design (owner-approved):
    11| *   Compact card with horizontal image carousel (up to 8 photos)
    12| *   Image counter pill (top-right)
    13| *   Status badge (top-left)
    14| *   Property title + location
    15| *   ROI / Min Investment metrics row
    16| *   Category chips (Tokenized / JV Deal / Buyer)
    17| *   Action row: Like, Comment, Save, Share
    18| *   CTA buttons: View Deal + Invest Now
    19| *   NO full-screen reel layout — always a card in a scroll feed
    20| */
    21|import React, { memo, useCallback, useMemo, useState } from 'react';
    22|import {
